    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my 7yo has a pretty nasty fever and a cough started last night. i gave him some tylenol earlier but it didnt seem to do much and he's still acting kinda sluggish. i have some extra strength aspirin in the cabinet, is it okay to give him a dose of that to help bring the fever down faster? he's really uncomfortable.",
