      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really worried because he's so lethargic. if i do give him that 81mg just once, is there anything else i can give him to help him sleep better? like can i mix it with some nyquil or maybe a little bit of some ibuprofen to make sure the fever really drops? i just want him to be able to rest.",
